Hermes Watcher

An independent integration for SenseCAP Watcher and Hermes Agent.
Not an official Seeed Studio or Nous Research product.

Firmware integration patches modify Seeed Studio's SenseCAP Watcher firmware:
https://github.com/Seeed-Studio/SenseCAP-Watcher-Firmware
Upstream license: Apache License 2.0 (included as LICENSE).
Modified areas: Hermes initialization, LVGL overlay, embedded sound assets,
and idle-only audio playback support. See firmware/integration.patch.
Additional integration source and documentation are distributed under Apache-2.0.

Audio: Interface Sounds 1.0 by Kenney, CC0-1.0.
https://kenney.nl/assets/interface-sounds
See firmware/overlay/main/view/hermes_audio/LICENSE.txt for the original notice.
The WAVs are converted, attenuated versions; permission/error cues repeat once.

Dependencies fetched by ESP-IDF or Git retain their own licenses and notices.
The complete upstream firmware and its dependency history are not redistributed here.
